\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The mapper landscape for Qwen3-4B$\to $1.7B under the unified audit protocol: gold-probability CHG over the student's own prefill, with 95\% bootstrap CIs. All primary-pair point estimates are negative and no configuration passes the replacement gate; calibration budget moves affine mapping by only $0.005$ on a fixed evaluation set; the architecture-anchored RAT, the gradient-trained MLP families (hatched bars span independent trainings), and the over-parameterized joint MLP sit inside the same band. The RAT, MLP, and joint-MLP bars are frozen-gate extensions; the remaining bars are confirmatory (Section~\ref {sec:tiers}).}}{5}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:landscape}{{2}{5}{The mapper landscape for Qwen3-4B$\to $1.7B under the unified audit protocol: gold-probability CHG over the student's own prefill, with 95\% bootstrap CIs. All primary-pair point estimates are negative and no configuration passes the replacement gate; calibration budget moves affine mapping by only $0.005$ on a fixed evaluation set; the architecture-anchored RAT, the gradient-trained MLP families (hatched bars span independent trainings), and the over-parameterized joint MLP sit inside the same band. The RAT, MLP, and joint-MLP bars are frozen-gate extensions; the remaining bars are confirmatory (Section~\ref {sec:tiers})}{figure.2}{}}
